  "prefLabel": "Liq 903.01 Pricing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 903.01 Pricing. The prevailing price on the date that goods are ordered from a warehouse or at time of purchase at a commission liquor store shall be the price of the merchandise.\n\nSource. #4720, eff 1-1-90; ss by #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss by #6391, eff 11-28-96, EXPIRED: 11-28-04\n\nNew. #9227, eff 8-6-08, EXPIRED: 8-6-16\n\nNew. #12210, eff 6-14-17; ss by #13225, eff 6-30-21; ss by #14475, eff 1-6-26, EXPIRES: 1-6-36",
